      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently praise Dr. Alan Namazi and the hospital staff for their attentive, unhurried consultations and genuine dedication to animal wellbeing. Reviewers appreciate that the veterinarians clearly outline medical options, explain test findings in detail, and maintain prompt post-treatment follow-ups with families."
      }
    },
