      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling of cats and dogs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the team calm bedside manner when treating anxious kittens, young puppies, and senior pets with chronic heart conditions. Reviewers note that procedures such as vaccinations and post-operative checks are conducted smoothly without alarming nervous companions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
