      "title": {
        "en": "Debate over medication and procedure fees"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Client feedback regarding veterinary expenses is divided. Several reviewers commend Dr. Namazi for avoiding redundant diagnostic tests and proposing practical budget-friendly alternatives. In contrast, other pet owners note higher markups on specialty medications and describe dental and surgical estimates as comparatively expensive."
      }
    }
